# Market Cap Data Source

http://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/views/all/

Order of market cap is as of 2nd Jan 2016.

See development/index.html

# Notes On Values

Hashes were fetched from block explorers or from github projects.

Hashes are preferred to block IDs and burn or issuing addresses.

For burns, the first block containing a burn transaction is used.

For issuances, the underlying protocol block containing the first issuance is
used.

Some block explorers start indexing at zero, some at one.

Where block zero has a date of EPOCH and zero for all fields, we use block one.

## Bilshares

NXT-style block id for genesis block, we zero-pad the hex encoded equivalent:

1144880232558980432

## BitCrystals

The Bitcoin transaction:

0000000000000000035e4faa9a392cb437248733c803274dd3e1753719c4c255

contains the first issuance of BitCrystals via Counterparty.

## Blockshares

Block id for block 1 from https://github.com/bitshares/bitshares-0.x/blob/master/libraries/blockchain/include/bts/blockchain/checkpoints.hpp

## Counterparty

We use the first Bitcoin block (278319) containing a Counterparty burn, as per https://blockscan.com/tx?block=278319 :

0000000000000000818895F3DC2C178629D3D2D8FA3EC4A3F8179821239FEC4D

## Gulden

Gulden block zero has a date in 2001:

6c5d71a461b5bff6742bb62e5be53978b8dec5103ce52d1aaab8c6a251582f92

Block one is in 2014:

756e5147f48e143f7468b881571ac947f39950819c82d8d17ee7ceaa8e3a6628

We use block zero as it is not EPOCH.

## Mastercoin

We use the first Bitcoin block (249560) containing a transaction to the exodus address, as per https://blockchain.info/address/1EXoDusjGwvnjZUyKkxZ4UHEf77z6A5S4P?offset=39500&filter=0 which is :

0000000000000056d99aba76175c2adacbfcd7179289e90308b88b143dd6592c

## Nxt

Nxt has no block hash, we use the block id. Its decimal value is:

2680262203532249785

## Ripple

Due to Ripple's history being lost, we use block 32569, the earliest available header hash, instead:

60A01EBF11537D8394EA1235253293508BDA7131D5F8710EFE9413AA129653A2

## Steller

Hash (not id) for first ledger: https://horizon.stellar.org/ledgers/1

39c2a3cd4141b2853e70d84601faa44744660334b48f3228e0309342e3f4eb48
